  "details": "CJose is C library implementing the Javascript Object Signing and Encryption (JOSE).  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * cjose: OpenIDC/cjose uses all-zero Content Encryption Key for AES-CBC-HMAC JWE encryption (CVE-2026-53939)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
